ointing to attacker-controlled server. It's a stretch.\n\nLet me instead look at the httpd's arbitrary file read via path traversal. The httpd maps /fs/* to /rc_filesys/doc/* and httpRpmFs serves files. The final_handler httpFileRegHandle. If there'","stream":true,"block":0}

