data: {"seq":486,"ts":"2026-08-28T08:50:40.132Z","id":"chatcmpl-tool-a14cf05291e79daf","name":"fw_get_function_source","is_error":false,"preview":"{\n \"source\": \"// addr=0x5308cc name=execFormatCmd arch=mips32be size=0\\nint execFormatCmd(char *format, ...)\\n{\\n  char s[260]; // [sp+1Ch] [-104h] BYREF\\n  va_list arg; // [sp+12Ch] [+Ch] BYREF\\n\\n  va_start(arg, format);\\n  vsprintf(s, format, arg);\\n  return tp_systemEx(s);\\n}\\n\",\n \"hint\": \"网络空差分：请求没进处理函数，不是漏洞。禁止 record_finding，禁止向用户写终态/能力验收。同一 port+payload 不要再打。via=net 不要带 input_path。启动未通则只允许空…(+56 chars)"}

