data: {"seq":683,"ts":"2026-08-28T08:53:37.198Z","text":"The DDNS RPM handler (NoipDdnsRpmHtm @ 0x48999c, CmxDdnsRpmHtm, DynDdnsRpmHtm) handle the form requests. These call swSet*DdnsCfg which via uclited/execFormatCmd may run a ddns update command. Let me examine NoipDdnsRpmHtm to see if the form values flow into a shell command via execForm","stream":true,"block":0}

