able finding.\n\nLet me wrap up with the summary to the user in Chinese. Let me report:\n1. 环境评估\n2. 已记录 finding F-mtcpruzk-6b35 (minidlnad heap overflow)\n3. 其他调查结论\n\nActually, given the user wants thoroughness, let me do one more quick check on uclited's DDNS command sink to potentially confirm a command injection — since that's the user's top interest (command injection). Let me find the uclited function that actually runs a ddns update command. Let me look at how uclited starts ddns. swDdnsStart is in httpd (calls ucDdnsStart). Let me check ucDdnsStart in uclited and where it builds the shell command.\n\nLet me search uclited for \"DdnsStart\" function.","stream":false,"block":0}

